OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FRather
OL,6,Fcloudy across the south this evening
OL,7,Fwith a few spots of rain, otherwise
OL,8,Fdry with long clear spells developing.
OL,9,FWith light winds, a touch of ground
OL,10,Ffrost is possible.
OL,11,
OL,12,CWednesday:FA chilly, dry start with
OL,13,Fsunny spells but showers reach
OL,14,FDumfries and Galloway through the
OL,15,Fmorning and Lothian and Borders in the
OL,16,Fafternoon. Winds turning more
OL,17,Fnorthwesterly and freshening.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
